### Exercise 2.1 {.unnumbered}

Fit a Poisson regression model predicting `wwwhr` from the predictors listed in the pre-registration. Display the results in a formatted table.

::: {.callout-tip collapse="true" title="Hint: glm() syntax"}
The key argument is `family = poisson(link = "log")`. Use `model_parameters() %>% print_html()` or `tidy() %>% kable()` for a clean table.
:::


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
wwwhr_model <- glm(wwwhr ~ wordsum + age + sex + reliten_3f + polviews + wrkhome, 
                   data = data_pos, 
                   family = poisson(link = "log"))
model_parameters(wwwhr_model) %>% print_html()
```

